### FinGuard API requests: open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request".
@base = http://localhost:8000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### List demo cases
GET {{base}}/cases

### Assess the conflicting-evidence case
POST {{base}}/cases/FG-DEMO-0001/assess

### Assess the unknown-pattern case (expected: abstain)
POST {{base}}/cases/FG-DEMO-0003/assess

### Active committee policy
GET {{base}}/policy
